<section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="faq-header">
            <h2 class="mcm-faq-title" id="faq-title">Did you know?</h2>
            <button class="faq-expand-all" id="faqExpandAll">
                <span class="expand-text">Expand all</span>
                <span class="collapse-text" style="display: none;">Collapse all</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-list" id="faqList">
                <div class="faq-item expanded" data-faq-index="0">
                    <div class="faq-question-control">
                        <h3 class="faq-question-heading" id="faq-heading-0">
                            <button class="faq-question-button"
                                    aria-expanded="true"
                                    data-collapse-tooltip="Collapse"
                                    data-expand-tooltip="Expand"
                                    id="faq-item-0">
                                <span class="faq-number">01/</span>
                                <span class="faq-question-text">One Microsoft Copilot experience across work and life</span>
                                <span class="faq-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg class="plus-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="display: none;">
                                        <path d="M7.92225 2.00449L8 2C8.34189 2 8.62367 2.25736 8.66218 2.58892L8.66667 2.66667V7.33333H13.3333C13.6752 7.33333 13.957 7.59069 13.9955 7.92225L14 8C14 8.34189 13.7426 8.62367 13.4111 8.66218L13.3333 8.66667H8.66667V13.3333C8.66667 13.6752 8.40931 13.957 8.07775 13.9955L8 14C7.65811 14 7.37633 13.7426 7.33782 13.4111L7.33333 13.3333V8.66667H2.66667C2.32478 8.66667 2.043 8.40931 2.00449 8.07775L2 8C2 7.65811 2.25736 7.37633 2.58892 7.33782L2.66667 7.33333H7.33333V2.66667C7.33333 2.32478 7.59069 2.043 7.92225 2.00449L8 2L7.92225 2.00449Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="minus-icon" style="display: block;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M2.66423 8.66671H13.3332C13.7014 8.66671 13.9999 8.36823 13.9999 8.00004C13.9999 7.63185 13.7014 7.33337 13.3332 7.33337H2.66423C2.29604 7.33337 1.99756 7.63185 1.99756 8.00004C1.99756 8.36823 2.29604 8.66671 2.66423 8.66671Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">
                            Collapse
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer" style="display: block;">
                        <p>Use Microsoft Copilot across work and life in a single experience, available on the web, desktop, and mobile. Whether you're using Windows, Mac, Microsoft Edge, or your mobile device, your Copilot experience stays connected.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item " data-faq-index="1">
                    <div class="faq-question-control">
                        <h3 class="faq-question-heading" id="faq-heading-1">
                            <button class="faq-question-button"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    data-collapse-tooltip="Collapse"
                                    data-expand-tooltip="Expand"
                                    id="faq-item-1">
                                <span class="faq-number">02/</span>
                                <span class="faq-question-text">No download or reinstall is required</span>
                                <span class="faq-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg class="plus-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="display: block;">
                                        <path d="M7.92225 2.00449L8 2C8.34189 2 8.62367 2.25736 8.66218 2.58892L8.66667 2.66667V7.33333H13.3333C13.6752 7.33333 13.957 7.59069 13.9955 7.92225L14 8C14 8.34189 13.7426 8.62367 13.4111 8.66218L13.3333 8.66667H8.66667V13.3333C8.66667 13.6752 8.40931 13.957 8.07775 13.9955L8 14C7.65811 14 7.37633 13.7426 7.33782 13.4111L7.33333 13.3333V8.66667H2.66667C2.32478 8.66667 2.043 8.40931 2.00449 8.07775L2 8C2 7.65811 2.25736 7.37633 2.58892 7.33782L2.66667 7.33333H7.33333V2.66667C7.33333 2.32478 7.59069 2.043 7.92225 2.00449L8 2L7.92225 2.00449Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="minus-icon" style="display: none;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M2.66423 8.66671H13.3332C13.7014 8.66671 13.9999 8.36823 13.9999 8.00004C13.9999 7.63185 13.7014 7.33337 13.3332 7.33337H2.66423C2.29604 7.33337 1.99756 7.63185 1.99756 8.00004C1.99756 8.36823 2.29604 8.66671 2.66423 8.66671Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">
                            Expand
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer" style="display: none;">
                        <p>The updated experience rolls out automatically. The next time you open Copilot after the update reaches you, you'll see the new experience.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item " data-faq-index="2">
                    <div class="faq-question-control">
                        <h3 class="faq-question-heading" id="faq-heading-2">
                            <button class="faq-question-button"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    data-collapse-tooltip="Collapse"
                                    data-expand-tooltip="Expand"
                                    id="faq-item-2">
                                <span class="faq-number">03/</span>
                                <span class="faq-question-text">Your conversations move with you while remaining separate by account</span>
                                <span class="faq-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg class="plus-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="display: block;">
                                        <path d="M7.92225 2.00449L8 2C8.34189 2 8.62367 2.25736 8.66218 2.58892L8.66667 2.66667V7.33333H13.3333C13.6752 7.33333 13.957 7.59069 13.9955 7.92225L14 8C14 8.34189 13.7426 8.62367 13.4111 8.66218L13.3333 8.66667H8.66667V13.3333C8.66667 13.6752 8.40931 13.957 8.07775 13.9955L8 14C7.65811 14 7.37633 13.7426 7.33782 13.4111L7.33333 13.3333V8.66667H2.66667C2.32478 8.66667 2.043 8.40931 2.00449 8.07775L2 8C2 7.65811 2.25736 7.37633 2.58892 7.33782L2.66667 7.33333H7.33333V2.66667C7.33333 2.32478 7.59069 2.043 7.92225 2.00449L8 2L7.92225 2.00449Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="minus-icon" style="display: none;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M2.66423 8.66671H13.3332C13.7014 8.66671 13.9999 8.36823 13.9999 8.00004C13.9999 7.63185 13.7014 7.33337 13.3332 7.33337H2.66423C2.29604 7.33337 1.99756 7.63185 1.99756 8.00004C1.99756 8.36823 2.29604 8.66671 2.66423 8.66671Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">
                            Expand
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer" style="display: none;">
                        <p>Existing chats, history, and files carry over automatically to the new experience. Work and personal conversations remain separate, keeping chat history, files, and organizational protections tied to the appropriate account.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item " data-faq-index="3">
                    <div class="faq-question-control">
                        <h3 class="faq-question-heading" id="faq-heading-3">
                            <button class="faq-question-button"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    data-collapse-tooltip="Collapse"
                                    data-expand-tooltip="Expand"
                                    id="faq-item-3">
                                <span class="faq-number">04/</span>
                                <span class="faq-question-text">Several Copilot features have new names</span>
                                <span class="faq-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg class="plus-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="display: block;">
                                        <path d="M7.92225 2.00449L8 2C8.34189 2 8.62367 2.25736 8.66218 2.58892L8.66667 2.66667V7.33333H13.3333C13.6752 7.33333 13.957 7.59069 13.9955 7.92225L14 8C14 8.34189 13.7426 8.62367 13.4111 8.66218L13.3333 8.66667H8.66667V13.3333C8.66667 13.6752 8.40931 13.957 8.07775 13.9955L8 14C7.65811 14 7.37633 13.7426 7.33782 13.4111L7.33333 13.3333V8.66667H2.66667C2.32478 8.66667 2.043 8.40931 2.00449 8.07775L2 8C2 7.65811 2.25736 7.37633 2.58892 7.33782L2.66667 7.33333H7.33333V2.66667C7.33333 2.32478 7.59069 2.043 7.92225 2.00449L8 2L7.92225 2.00449Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="minus-icon" style="display: none;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M2.66423 8.66671H13.3332C13.7014 8.66671 13.9999 8.36823 13.9999 8.00004C13.9999 7.63185 13.7014 7.33337 13.3332 7.33337H2.66423C2.29604 7.33337 1.99756 7.63185 1.99756 8.00004C1.99756 8.36823 2.29604 8.66671 2.66423 8.66671Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">
                            Expand
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer" style="display: none;">
                        <p>We've aligned feature names across experiences to create a more consistent Microsoft Copilot experience.<ul><li>Project → Notebook</li><li>Tasks → Cowork</li><li>Deep Research → Researcher</li><li>Study and Learn mode → Guided Learning</li></ul></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item " data-faq-index="4">
                    <div class="faq-question-control">
                        <h3 class="faq-question-heading" id="faq-heading-4">
                            <button class="faq-question-button"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    data-collapse-tooltip="Collapse"
                                    data-expand-tooltip="Expand"
                                    id="faq-item-4">
                                <span class="faq-number">05/</span>
                                <span class="faq-question-text">Copilot Chat helps you ask questions, explore ideas, and get things done</span>
                                <span class="faq-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg class="plus-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="display: block;">
                                        <path d="M7.92225 2.00449L8 2C8.34189 2 8.62367 2.25736 8.66218 2.58892L8.66667 2.66667V7.33333H13.3333C13.6752 7.33333 13.957 7.59069 13.9955 7.92225L14 8C14 8.34189 13.7426 8.62367 13.4111 8.66218L13.3333 8.66667H8.66667V13.3333C8.66667 13.6752 8.40931 13.957 8.07775 13.9955L8 14C7.65811 14 7.37633 13.7426 7.33782 13.4111L7.33333 13.3333V8.66667H2.66667C2.32478 8.66667 2.043 8.40931 2.00449 8.07775L2 8C2 7.65811 2.25736 7.37633 2.58892 7.33782L2.66667 7.33333H7.33333V2.66667C7.33333 2.32478 7.59069 2.043 7.92225 2.00449L8 2L7.92225 2.00449Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="minus-icon" style="display: none;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M2.66423 8.66671H13.3332C13.7014 8.66671 13.9999 8.36823 13.9999 8.00004C13.9999 7.63185 13.7014 7.33337 13.3332 7.33337H2.66423C2.29604 7.33337 1.99756 7.63185 1.99756 8.00004C1.99756 8.36823 2.29604 8.66671 2.66423 8.66671Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">
                            Expand
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer" style="display: none;">
                        <p>Copilot Chat provides AI-powered assistance across work and life through natural conversation. If you previously used Bing AI or Bing Chat, those experiences have evolved into Microsoft Copilot and are now part of the Copilot experience.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item " data-faq-index="5">
                    <div class="faq-question-control">
                        <h3 class="faq-question-heading" id="faq-heading-5">
                            <button class="faq-question-button"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    data-collapse-tooltip="Collapse"
                                    data-expand-tooltip="Expand"
                                    id="faq-item-5">
                                <span class="faq-number">06/</span>
                                <span class="faq-question-text">Microsoft Copilot is free with a signed-in Microsoft account</span>
                                <span class="faq-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg class="plus-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="display: block;">
                                        <path d="M7.92225 2.00449L8 2C8.34189 2 8.62367 2.25736 8.66218 2.58892L8.66667 2.66667V7.33333H13.3333C13.6752 7.33333 13.957 7.59069 13.9955 7.92225L14 8C14 8.34189 13.7426 8.62367 13.4111 8.66218L13.3333 8.66667H8.66667V13.3333C8.66667 13.6752 8.40931 13.957 8.07775 13.9955L8 14C7.65811 14 7.37633 13.7426 7.33782 13.4111L7.33333 13.3333V8.66667H2.66667C2.32478 8.66667 2.043 8.40931 2.00449 8.07775L2 8C2 7.65811 2.25736 7.37633 2.58892 7.33782L2.66667 7.33333H7.33333V2.66667C7.33333 2.32478 7.59069 2.043 7.92225 2.00449L8 2L7.92225 2.00449Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="minus-icon" style="display: none;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M2.66423 8.66671H13.3332C13.7014 8.66671 13.9999 8.36823 13.9999 8.00004C13.9999 7.63185 13.7014 7.33337 13.3332 7.33337H2.66423C2.29604 7.33337 1.99756 7.63185 1.99756 8.00004C1.99756 8.36823 2.29604 8.66671 2.66423 8.66671Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">
                            Expand
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer" style="display: none;">
                        <p>A free tier is available with a Microsoft account. Copilot AI helps you research, create, and get answers, with some capabilities subject to usage limits and more available through paid plans. You can also use Word, Excel, and PowerPoint free on the web. Microsoft 365 subscriptions include the Microsoft Copilot app, desktop versions of familiar productivity apps, and additional premium features.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item " data-faq-index="6">
                    <div class="faq-question-control">
                        <h3 class="faq-question-heading" id="faq-heading-6">
                            <button class="faq-question-button"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    data-collapse-tooltip="Collapse"
                                    data-expand-tooltip="Expand"
                                    id="faq-item-6">
                                <span class="faq-number">07/</span>
                                <span class="faq-question-text">You&#x27;re in control of your data and AI experiences</span>
                                <span class="faq-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <svg class="plus-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="display: block;">
                                        <path d="M7.92225 2.00449L8 2C8.34189 2 8.62367 2.25736 8.66218 2.58892L8.66667 2.66667V7.33333H13.3333C13.6752 7.33333 13.957 7.59069 13.9955 7.92225L14 8C14 8.34189 13.7426 8.62367 13.4111 8.66218L13.3333 8.66667H8.66667V13.3333C8.66667 13.6752 8.40931 13.957 8.07775 13.9955L8 14C7.65811 14 7.37633 13.7426 7.33782 13.4111L7.33333 13.3333V8.66667H2.66667C2.32478 8.66667 2.043 8.40931 2.00449 8.07775L2 8C2 7.65811 2.25736 7.37633 2.58892 7.33782L2.66667 7.33333H7.33333V2.66667C7.33333 2.32478 7.59069 2.043 7.92225 2.00449L8 2L7.92225 2.00449Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <svg class="minus-icon" style="display: none;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                        <path d="M2.66423 8.66671H13.3332C13.7014 8.66671 13.9999 8.36823 13.9999 8.00004C13.9999 7.63185 13.7014 7.33337 13.3332 7.33337H2.66423C2.29604 7.33337 1.99756 7.63185 1.99756 8.00004C1.99756 8.36823 2.29604 8.66671 2.66423 8.66671Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <span class="faq-toggle-tooltip" aria-hidden="true">
                            Expand
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer" style="display: none;">
                        <p>Microsoft Copilot is designed with privacy, security, and transparency in mind. Copilot AI responds only when you choose to use it, and your existing privacy and security settings continue to apply. Learn more in the Microsoft Privacy Statement and Copilot trust resources.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
        </div>
        
    </div>
</section>

